  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Young African Leaders Initiative (YALI) - AKBULANCE (Emergency Medical Dispatch System)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">AKTECH Computer systems will build an emergency medical dispatch system and electronic communication that interconnects hospitals, ambulances and patients. Each patient who visits any of those hospitals receives a short code to call during emergency. AKBULANCE call center directs an awaiting ambulance to patient location and page the hospital via a digital network interface.</narrative>
  </description>
